<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">assemble-thornwall-harness</ansi> (tailoring recipe)

Veyra's masterwork assembly. The finished piece is joined here from four
self-crafted components and its bulk stock. This recipe is taught by
commission, never discovered at the bench, and it demands that every
component be of your own making.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       tailoring (minimum 65)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     loom
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Barbed Spike-Plates (x1), Anti-Corrosion Quench (x1),
               Ironwood Thorn-Heart (x1), Scab-Chitin Plate (x1),
               Leather Strip (x8), Sinew (x6)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Learned:</ansi>     by commission from Veyra (not self-taught)

